Package: anthroDisturbanceUtils
Title: Utilities for the Anthropogenic Disturbance 'SpaDES' Modules
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tati", "Micheletti", , "tati.micheletti@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Alex M.", "Chubaty", , "achubaty@for-cast.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7146-8135")),
    person("Ronald", "Kilian", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Helpers shared by the anthropogenic disturbance 'SpaDES' modules
    ('anthroDisturbance_DataPrep', 'anthroDisturbance_Generator' and
    'potentialResources'): writing a list of disturbance layers to disk as an
    indexed archive, and reading it back as 'terra' vector layers; combining,
    cleaning and replacing the layers of such a list; and mapping where any
    disturbance is present.
